    "text": "kqennewsradio.com\nwebsite\nDouglas County, Oregon\nHEAT ADVISORY CONTINUES THROUGH 8:00 P.M. WEDNESDAY\n1 days ago\nA Heat Advisory continues through 8:00 p.m. Wednesday for central Douglas County and its eastern foothills. Forecasters at the National Weather Service in Medford said high temperatures in the 90s to around 100 degrees are expected. Low temperatures will be mainly in the upper 50s to mid-60s. The Advisory area...\n1",
